tacked wooden buildings. Classical Chinese architectural style roofs. Bright golden-yellow nightlights enveloping the entire building. The details of the building's structure are clear, sharp, and realistic.\n\nA vibrant night scene of Chongqing, with highways, guardrails, cars, and pedestrians in the distance. Not blurry, not generic, not similar to anywhere else—it must be distinctly Hongyadong Chongqing.\n\n Pose & Composition:\nThe subject stands at the edge of the road with a guardrail, her body slightly turned to the side (three-quarter angle), her shoulders facing the camera, and her head turned back toward the lens. The facial expression is soft, calm, feminine, and natural. The pose is candid yet aesthetic.\n\nLighting & Camera:\nStrong front flash photography from the phone's rear camera. The face and upper body are bright and sharp, with soft shadows that add dimension. The Hongyadong lights remain dominant in the background, creating a realistic nighttime contrast. There is no blur, no excessive noise, and the focus is very sharp, especially on the face and makeup.\n\nMakeup – Chinese Douyin Style: Douyin makeup that adheres to and suits the nighttime atmosphere:\nBright white skin, a moist glow, and a natural skin texture. Flawless and realistic base makeup. Natural, slightly messy eyebrows. Soft pink blush on the cheeks and the tip of the nose. High highlights on the cheekbones, nose, and cupid's bow. Nude pink-peach gradient eyeshadow. Thin eyeliner along the lashline. Gray eyeshadow.  Thick, long, and clearly separated manhua-style false eyelashes. Ombre lips with a nude base and dark red inner lip blend perfectly for a fresh, juicy matte finish.\n\nHair:\nVery long, jet black hair with a smooth, soft texture and a sheen in the night light. Styled wavy, a few strands of hair naturally flow in the night breeze, covering part of the face.\n\nOOTD:\nMaterial: Semi-transparent, stretchy, soft-flowing fabric (mesh/stretch tulle)\nModel: Off-shoulder long, bodycon dress that reaches the ankles, with a slim silhouette, a straight cut, and natural ruffle details.\nStyle: Modern minimalist with a touch of high-fashion resort style.\nPatterns: Abstract gradient motifs resembling marble paintings.\n\nColors: Earth tones—brown, burnt orange, bluish gray, and a touch of transparent black.\nGives an elegant, artistic, and mature impression, blending in with the Hongyadong nightlife.\n\nAccessories: Thin, minimalist gold necklace that subtly reflects the flash.\n\n Final Quality:\nUltra-realistic photography, high resolution, sharp focus, natural color grading, realistic look, very clear face and makeup, looks like a real photo taken in Hongyadong, Chongqing at night."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#04ff00", "size": [409.49652099609375, 252.97923278808594], "pos": [583.603759765625, 1327.2593994140625], "id": 13, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.9.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-346.96594154375236, -412.64711011794833], "scale": 0.8769226950000027}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Image Size", "bounding": [1007.14794921875, 1283.3917236328125, 380, 350]}], "links": [[1, 10, 0, 1, 0, "MODEL"], [2, 8, 0, 3, 0, "LATENT"], [3, 2, 0, 3, 1, "VAE"], [4, 6, 0, 4, 0, "CLIP"], [5, 6, 0, 7, 0, "CLIP"], [6, 1, 0, 8, 0, "MODEL"], [7, 4, 0, 8, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [8, 7, 0, 8, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [9, 5, 0, 8, 3, "LATENT"], [10, 3, 0, 9, 0, "IMAGE"], [11, 14, 0, 8, 4, "INT"], [12, 11, 